          "commands": [],
          "description": "Cancels a job and answers with the job. A job not yet sent to a Runner, or paused, ends \`cancelled\` at once. Otherwise the cancel waits for its Runner, shown as \`pendingControl\`, replacing a waiting pause, and the job ends \`cancelled\` once the Runner has stopped it, keeping its events and costs. A job that has ended, or ends before its Runner stops it, keeps the status and output it ended with.",
          "name": "cancel",
          "options": [
            {
              "attributeName": "id",
              "description": "The job's ID.; Format: uuid; Pattern: ^([0-9a-fA-F]{8}-[0-9a-fA-F]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[89abAB][0-9a-fA-F]{3}-[0-9a-fA-F]{12}|00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000|ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff)$",
